ic Safety  double Hunters to just interfere and  kill it the reason for this rule is to  presumably protect the earnings of  Civilian Hunters who get paid based on  the Devils they capture and kill but in  this scene power just completely ignores  it as she splashes the sea cucumber in a  moment that was both colorful and  brilliantly animated now before we dive  into my personal rating for the episode  one thing I didn't find time to mention  was the painting in makima's office  which was visible as Aki pulled denji  across the floor this artwork seems to  be a similar style to the painting we  see in chapter 81 called the fall of  Lucifer which depicted Satan falling  from Heaven although the two paintings  aren't the same they definitely have the  same biblical tone so if you have any  idea where this new painting is from  then let me know in the comments Down  Below in terms of my thoughts on the  episode it did a lot of things that I  liked including amazing shots like the  one of makima's eye power destroying the  sea cucumber and the camera work on  Powers chess so I say that visually it  is more pleasing than episode 1. the one  thing I didn't like was that they  removed the muscle devil and don't get  me wrong I'm not pretending that this  was a big deal but I was kind of  surprised that they took it out  completely my guess is that they must  have like a specific point where they  won the the season to end and to reach  that point in the amount of episodes  they have I guess this was just a  necessary thing that had to be caught  however the reason I was surprised they  took it out is because last week during  episode one I mean that was the perfect  adaptation of the first chapter and so  to see such a huge chunk of episode two  you know being missing that was a big  shock overall though I'd still give this  episode a 9.5 out of 10. and if you want  these chainsaw man breakdowns to  continue then don't forget to hit that  sub button and drop a like if you